    "intro_html":  "Chicken thighs braised in a deep red paprika and sour cream sauce over buttered egg noodles. This is a big bowl on purpose: \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e and {{cal}} calories of old-world comfort for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). Grandma-level cooking at gas-station-snack pricing.",
